Always stash scrolls...either in an actual stash, or at least inside an
inventory bag to keep them protected against fire events. Potions too.

>Currently My 2 experiencedpets large dog/large cat areclearing out a
>throne room on DL 7-ish (I forget). Is throne sitting worth it?

If you have a unicorn horn, there are no effects of throne sitting that are
really all that dire. You can occasionally get "the audience" summoned, but
then you just kill them. Vs the possibility of a free wish or a geno, it's
quite worthwhile. Just be aware that most of the time you'll get 2-3 sits
with no effect and then the throne will vanish. A typical ascension game
will have 3-5 thrones (there are 2 guaranteed thrones in all games, 1 in
Ludios which is fairly likely, and then they also randomly show up) in it,
and most of the time none of them will yield anything.

