>Any other good strategy for my Wiz? He is doing rather well Ring of
>slow digestion helps, but I want to keep him alive, I think this guy
>has a shot to get far.

Wizards have the huge benefit of starting with the CoMR, which immediately
covers 2 of the 4 major required defenses...magic resistance and magic
cancellation. Do whatever it takes to get reflection. An amulet is best
until you can make or wish for SDSM, but a shield will do in a pinch.


